{"schema_version":"1.9.0","id":"ALSA-2026:55865","published":"2026-08-17T00:00:00Z","modified":"2026-08-18T13:15:03.027482092Z","related":["CVE-2026-19387","CVE-2026-19389"],"summary":"Important: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free and gstreamer1-plugins-ugly-free security update","details":"GStreamer is a streaming media framework based on graphs of filters which operate on media data. The gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free package contains a collection of plug-ins for GStreamer.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free: gstreamer: heap out-of-bounds write in adpcmdec IMA/DVI ADPCM decoder (CVE-2026-19387)\n  * gstreamer: gstreamer1-plugins-ugly-free: gstreamer: integer overflow/underflow in asfdemux bounds checks leading to out-of-bounds read (CVE-2026-19389)\n\n\nFor more details about the security issue(s), including the impact, a CVSS score, acknowledgments, and other related information, refer to the CVE page(s) listed in the References section.\n","affected":[{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:55865.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-devel"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/AlmaLinux/osv-database/blob/master/advisories/almalinux9/ALSA-2026:55865.json"}},{"package":{"name":"gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-libs","ecosystem":"AlmaLinux:9","purl":"pkg:rpm/almalinux/gstreamer1-plugins-bad-free-libs"},"ranges":[{"type":"ECOSYSTEM","events":[{"introduced":"0"},{"fixed":"1.22.12-7.el9_8.4"}]}],"database_specific":{"source":"https://github.com/A